WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,780
Mr. Su, the auction takes about twenty minutes by car.

2
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:16,820
Let me first introduce you to the details of the auction.

3
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,260
There are six pieces of land auctioned today.

4
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,380
Distributed in the core area of Menggui City

5
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,980
But the real weight is the last piece

6
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,460
Tragic loss of old land

7
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,980
Therefore, Mr. Su, you must take a photo of this land

8
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,890
Well, that's it. But the land is too big.

9
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:35,370
I'm afraid I can't eat it

10
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,650
How about buying some scraps?

11
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,810
This Mr. Su

12
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:42,490
In fact, the owner of our Menggui Hotel

13
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:44,010
Also interested in this land

14
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,650
Willing to jointly invest with you

15
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:47,580
What do you think

16
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:50,430
When asking for help, you must have the attitude of asking for help.

17
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:52,310
are you right

18
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:54,470
Actual manager of the hotel

19
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,670
Miss Red Smoke
